# What the build context is allowed to contain.
#
# THIS IS NOT A COPY OF .gitignore. `.gitignore` decides what gets published;
# this decides what gets sent to the Docker daemon, and the two answers differ.
# A tracked file that the running system never reads is still dead weight here,
# and an untracked local artifact tree is worse than dead weight -- `artifacts/`
# alone is multiple gigabytes, and every byte of it would be tarred up and
# shipped to the daemon on every single build.
#
# The rule: include what `python -m console.server` actually imports or serves.

# --- Version control and build output ---------------------------------------
**/.git/
.gitignore
.github/
**/build/
**/dist/
*.egg-info/
**/.eggs/

# --- Python bytecode and tool caches ----------------------------------------
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.jax_cache/
**/.jax-cache/
.cache/
**/.cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Environments -----------------------------------------------------------
**/.venv/
**/venv/
.env
**/.tools/

# --- Generated trees --------------------------------------------------------
# `artifacts/` is run output and captured worlds; `storage/` is the console's
# own store. Both are mounted at run time as a volume, never baked into a layer:
# an image carrying one run's output is not a reproducible starting point.
artifacts/
**/artifacts/
storage/
**/logs/
**/output/
telemetry/*.jsonl
telemetry/*.jsonl.gz
adk/runs/*
!adk/runs/__init__.py

# --- Reverse-engineered sources ---------------------------------------------
# Never in an image, for the same reason they are never in the repository.
decompiled/
**/decompiled/
decompile/
**/decompile/
decomp/
**/decomp/

# --- Test suites ------------------------------------------------------------
# The image runs the console; it does not run the suites. `docker compose run
# --rm console pytest ...` against a bind-mounted tree is how you test, which
# keeps the shipped image small and its contents honest about being runtime.
tests/
**/tests/
test/
**/test/
test-results/
junit*.xml

# --- Trees with no runtime consumer -----------------------------------------
# None of these is imported by the console or by `arena.training`.
experimental/
**/mods/
**/docs/
HytaleRL/docs/
HytaleRL/examples/
HytaleRL/hytale-plugin/
HytaleRL/protocol/
HytaleRL/scripts/
**/.codex-local/
**/.codex/
**/.claude/
**/.agents/
skills/
**/skills/
!arena/training/skills/

# --- Model and capture blobs ------------------------------------------------
*.npz
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.pkl
*.zip
*.jar
*.class

# --- Editor and OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# --- Docker's own files -----------------------------------------------------
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore

# --- Local tooling that is not runtime -------------------------------------
**/.playwright-cli/
**/.playwright-mcp/
*AGENT-INSTRUCTIONS*.md
